Tags: subscribers, opt-in
Requires at least: 2.0.2
Tested up to: 3.1
Stable tag: 4.3

An opt-in plugin for signing up to email lists.

== Description ==

GetMore is a email opt-in plugin that adds users to an ExactTarget list using the web collect method.

== Installation ==

This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.

e.g.

1. Upload `plugin-name.php` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress


